<title>BRAZIL: Brazil June 27 coffee regs 3.18 mln bags to August.</title>
<headline>Brazil June 27 coffee regs 3.18 mln bags to August.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee sales registrations as of June 27 totaled 3.18 million 60-kg bags for June, July and August, according to the July 7 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>Of this, 1.30 million bags had been registered for June.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REG 60-KG BAGS-June 27    REG 60-KG BAGS-June 20</p>
<p> June		   1,300,542		1,342,077</p>
<p> July		   1,355,854		1,231,793</p>
<p> August		   527,111		  479,750</p>
<p> TOTAL		  3,183,507		3,053,620</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
